notes.body:
I still do not see the point of making an explicit reference to the preferences, so I will let other decide. But IMHO the wording and use of parenthesis is a bit awkward. Something like 

proto_tree_add_uint_format_value(sctp_tree, hf_sctp_assoc_index, tvb, 0 , 0, sctp_info.assoc_index, "disabled (enable in preferences)");

Sounds better to me.

